* The number of roots of X ( M X + 1 ) modulo a squarefree D none of whose prime divisors divides M is 2 raised to the number of those primes.

s1::simp1 |- ( ( M e. NN /\ ( D e. NN /\ ( mmu ` D ) =/= 0 ) /\ A. r e. Prime ( r || D -> -. r || M ) ) -> M e. NN )
